      "created_at": "2012-12-02T14:40:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Beckyzoole\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/beckyzoole/48/2657_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Beckyzoole:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I know I <strong>must</strong> see:<br>The Hobbit<br>Lincoln<br>Skyfall<br>Les Miserables</p>\n<p>I was very excited about Anna Karenina, but the reviews are bad.</p>\n<p>I would like to see Life of Pi, but I'm afraid it won't be anywhere near as good as the book.</p>\n<p>I loved Cloud Atlas. I'm disappointed that it didn't do better in theaters.</p>\n<p>So, what are you going to see?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am looking forward to the Hobbit as well.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have seen Skyfall and I highly recommend it as it is an awesome Bond film.</p>\n<p>I would also like to see Lincoln as it seems the most true and least dramatized version of his life.</p>\n<p>The rest are rentals at best in my opinion as they are probably not going to be as good as the source material.</p>",
