      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/e56c9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-02T18:50:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Top on my list: The Hobbit. Hopefully NOT 3D and hopefully not IMAX either. IMAX 3D would be a total nightmare :/</p><p>Life of Pi</p><p>Also interested in a Dutch movie called Koning van Katoren (King of Katoren). It's based on a well-known children's novel. A novel that really fascinated me when I was a kid. Nostalgia basically. What worries me is that it's translated from a Medieval setting to a moddern setting (with smart phones and all).</p>",
